 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Lots of little gestures can make a big difference. A family dinner every now and then. A shared vacation in year with no stores. A card with few dollars as an envelope of fresh fruit. A shared vacation together as family. A gift card to a restaurant everyone likes. Or a shared exercise membership. Then lead by example and show her how much it means when it comes from her. Pick something you all would enjoy together and lead by going first. It' the thought that counts, and showing that you value everyone together is the key.",
